# CADASTRAR
###
POST {{baseURL}}/usuarios
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "nome": "teste",
    "email": "teste3@gmail.com",
    "password": "123456",
    "admin": true,
    "nivel_id": 1
}

# BUSCAR USUÁRIOS
###
GET {{baseURL}}/usuarios
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# BUSCAR UM USUARIO PELO ID
###
GET {{baseURL}}/usuarios/4
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# ATUALIZAR USUARIO
###
